[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0010","text":"……嗯—那个\n啊，对了……这里改一下的话……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0020","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0030","text":"……小糸？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0040","text":"咿……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0050","text":"那、那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0060","text":"怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0070","text":"那，那个…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0080","text":"关于『Unit Live』\n有什么想问的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0090","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0100","text":"那个……\n希望能成为一场好的舞台……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0110","text":"嗯，是啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0120","text":"小糸如果有什么演出的想法\n也积极提出来吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0130","text":"──……！\n那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0140","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0150","text":"哈哈，那种事也不是一下子就能想出来的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0160","text":"…………\n辛、辛苦了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0170","text":"啊，辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0172","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_02220000_01_0180","text":"…………"}]
